     3729     if xDens          then do: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3730     repeat i = 1 to 13 :
     3731       if i = 7 then next.
     3732       if NOT xShowCost      and i = 2   Then  next.
     3733       if NOT xShowCostNDS   and i = 3   Then  next.
     3734       if NOT xShowCrsa      and i = 5   Then  next.
     3735       if NOT xShowCrsaNds   and i = 6   Then  next.
